# Copy to .env (gitignored) on the server.
# Host address the web board is published on. Default 0.0.0.0 = IPv4 only, all interfaces.
# Never remove the IP from the port mapping in docker-compose.yml: without it Docker also
# listens on IPv6, which may be reachable from the internet.
# Narrowing to the server's LAN address is possible, but then that address must exist before
# Docker starts at boot (see "Binding to a LAN address" in README).
# BIND_IP=192.168.50.69
